{"server":"tw","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_08_beg","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_08","title":"曠古之晤","storyCode":"WB-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b708fc0d54a1d2a34668c792f3084dba56a0a0f9edef4cd7ec83419b1b7b5d97","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"天災將近，玉門軍民上下齊心共同為抵擋天災做最後的準備。城樓下，在萬眾矚目中，槐天裴與重岳遲到了三年的比武終於開始。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被擠到的百姓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的行李掉了，別擠別擠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"時間還夠，請大家有秩序地撤離，不要驚慌，避免踩踏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽媽媽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚，我怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努力鎮定的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，抓緊媽媽的手，別走丟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們去哪啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努力鎮定的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們住的地方，每年都要刮上幾次大風，這次也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努力鎮定的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不想被吹跑呀，就乖乖躲一躲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴隨著隆隆聲響，龐大而方正的陰影自玉門城牆外升起，漸漸遮住了半邊日頭——\n“玉門四衛”。四組被稱作“屏風衛”的外掛移動防護牆體，由土木天師專門設計，軍中冶造司承造。\n數百年來，玉門作為炎國的屏障，戍守塞上；屏風衛作為玉門的屏障，抵禦著來自大漠深處的沙塵、冬風與各類源石塵暴。\n四衛不傾，三風不度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乖乖，好高......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來到玉門三年，我還沒看過屏風衛升起來呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少見多怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門基礎牆體本來就高，加上城頭架設了全套的源石防禦工事，一般規模的天災，需要啟動屏風衛的次數很少，但也不是沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這次為了避災遷移半城的百姓，我入伍以來倒還沒經歷過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，這天災，得是什麼級別，屏風衛都擋不住嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"屏風衛已經固定完畢，精鋼板塊彼此間榫合得嚴絲合縫，連風也透不進來。\n排成長隊的百姓在它投下的陰影裡，向城牆的相反方向行進。或許是厚重堅實的屏風衛讓大家安了心，短暫的混亂後，人群恢復了秩序。\n長行塞外，胡楊早已習慣了風沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，你小子怕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別瞎想，堅守崗位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把眼睛放亮些，那幫山海眾還混在城裡。現在正是人流密集，最容易出事的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保護好百姓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，您怎麼還不走啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"廣播都放了好幾遍，玉門快要撞上天災了，城東的住戶要在今天中午前搬到城西的避難點去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到啦，不急，不急。那天災雲還沒到眼前呢，我得收拾收拾東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"這一屋子桌椅板凳倒也罷了，這本菜譜可是命根子，不能弄丟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這次要是運氣不好，這間客棧沒保下來，不如您和我一起去龍門吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哎怪我多嘴，說些不吉利的話，呸呸呸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"只是來的這幾天，蒙您照顧，我想著憑您的手藝，在龍門開家飯館生意肯定也紅火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是走了，這裡的人就再吃不到我這一手獨門秘製醬獸肉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆是玉門本地人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"老家在中原，本來是去龍門謀生計。有一次想往更北邊的地方看看，就趁著城市對接的機會來了玉門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"當時弄丟了錢包，就留在這家客棧打工，一轉眼，自己當掌櫃都這麼多年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"房子算不上可惜......只要人還在，家就在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"是這個道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門暗樁","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我陪您快點收拾吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"無風。\n即使隔得很遠，深色的詭異氣團依然遮蔽了小半個天空。\n天災雲看起來沒有移動，空氣卻越來越燥熱。\n彷彿只等一陣風起，就會在眨眼間吹落城頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左將軍也有心情來旁觀我大哥的比武？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抗災事宜已經安排妥當。宗師想趕在天災之前看看那人是否值得託付，我又怎能不來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是用這種辦法決定劍的歸處，左某始終覺得荒唐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你與我大哥幾十年的袍澤情誼，哪怕是作為朋友，也不願意相信他的選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們同赴沙場，卻談不上生死與共。刀槍炮火傷不到你們，你們又怎能真正體會人的袍澤情誼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們終究置身事外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“置身事外”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我貪個“逍遙”，你這樣說我倒也罷了，可對於大哥他，未免有些不公。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人獸有別，亙古不變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"令小姐應該清楚朝廷對你們的態度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若能有人與你們相頡頏，則可以將你們視作助力。若無人能相制衡，那寧可不用你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不如他，所以我不能毫無保留地相信他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到，左將軍也會這樣坦誠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你未免太看輕自己了......"},{"type":"narration","text":"左宣遼無言望向城外大漠，城下人影依稀，像是蒼茫畫卷上飛濺出了兩點殘墨。\n天地肅殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那段日子，彷彿還在昨天一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在征戰之餘，我們也曾四處遊獵，飲酒高歌。玉門依然是玉門，為什麼偏偏是平祟侯，為那麼多事愁白了頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看著這兩人，你可曾想起那段崢嶸歲月？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說人獸有別，可你看看，偏偏此刻就有人在挑戰這道溝壑屏障。這樣的較量，難道不令人心潮澎湃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別皺著眉頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝口酒？不如我們押個輸贏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你終於肯應戰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓你等了這麼久，見諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三年而已，算不上多久。你要是還有事情沒做完，我可以再等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三年前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停停停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這才第一合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才一合之內我們對了三拳，以你我的功力，真打實了，這時候大概已經有人見了傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你收著勁，我也不能出全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒意思，不痛快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比武試招，點到即止......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰跟你比武試招，哪來的點到即止，要打就要全力以赴地打！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天下武功，都是搏殺之術，哪一樣不是在真正的生死歷練中演化成型。你這話，不像是玉門擂台榜上第一名會說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在理。不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，知道你還有職責在身，真打起來難免束手束腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什麼時候卸任？我們把這一場續上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不知道要等到何年何月了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說一個時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......短則三五年，長則十幾年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那我等著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正你就在這城裡，我也不怕你跑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情永遠是做不完的，欠下的這一戰，放在此時此地，剛剛好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡面有我的一點私心，應該向你說明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去三軍出征，有先鋒將領在校場演武，激勵士氣的傳統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今玉門即將迎戰天災，你我在陣前比這一場，就當為全城的將士們壯壯膽色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無所謂，就怕你在全城人面前被我打趴下，面子上過不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，已經有很多年，沒人像你這樣向我挑戰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經有很多年，沒人像你這樣值得我挑戰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放開手腳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當盡全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勝負在己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生死有命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣？開打了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你傷還沒好，怎麼這麼急著下床活動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開玩笑，好歹我也是練過幾年功夫的，身體素質沒那麼差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，傷可以再養，這種級別的打架要是錯過了，我上哪再看去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看也沒有什麼了不起的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個菲林大叔，就是你嘴裡那個不可靠的老爹吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是父女，你和你爹還真是挺像的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡像？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開打前的氣勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好傢伙，像是要把人吃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過傳聞那位宗師的武功高到了匪夷所思的地步，這幾年已經很少真的出手了。更誇張的說法是，天下近半數的武功是他發明的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說你爹昨晚還打敗了那個壞女人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你猜猜，誰能贏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遙夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用問，你當然還是想讓自己爹贏的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的輸贏，是他的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想親眼看看，我和他到底還有多少差距。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種擼袖子掄胳膊的事情，梁大人竟然也會來湊熱鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為朋友，應該來看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“天下聞名”，不知道他算不算達成了這個目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看多少雙眼睛盯著這場比武，不論誰勝誰負，江湖都要多一樁美談了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個癡人，在讓別人知道自己是誰之前，要先給自己一個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都要給自己一個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來是在專心找槐天裴，但又有些麻煩找了上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幹回偵探老本行，打聽到了一些事情，也大概猜到了，你的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩總是找上你，或許是有原因的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當大哥的，總得操心自己的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你都打聽到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位宗師是令小姐的兄長，這件事在玉門並非人盡皆知。甚至該說是，秘密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的確......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師丟的那把劍，找回來固然是當務之急，但更麻煩的是之後該如何處置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人不想讓它留在玉門，或許是司歲台的意思，或許是作為玉門參知的考量。但偏偏那位平祟侯不願意放手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你需要一個人，可以帶走這把劍，還能讓兩邊都信服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你正好有一個武藝高強的結義兄弟，他正好就在城中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了讓槐天裴和整件事情關聯得更緊些，將那個盜劍的女孩子引到他所在的醫館，也只是順勢為之了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從尚蜀到玉門，每次你都找老朋友來幫你解決問題，是不是太偷懶了一點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的朋友，並不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一個疑問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次，你是從什麼時候開始，準備讓槐天裴入局的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，也不必告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你動了多少心思，挑戰最強的高手，成為最強的高手，畢竟是他的夙願。就算他回過頭知道了你在推波助瀾，指不定還會謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都在努力做原本想做的事，哪怕世事總是不太如人意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能這些年過去，他才是離初心理想最近的那個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“一輩子只做成一件事”，說說容易啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位槐先生，竟然會帶著傷來赴約......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他這樣的人，別說受傷，哪怕只有一口氣吊著，也會來比這一場。死了就死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道槐先生來玉門只為與老師一戰，老師也承諾了。老師偶爾跟我說起這件事，他的期待，其實不輸槐先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"習武之人，哪個不渴望對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也算是一種執念吧。莫名其妙得很，你不理解也正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像師姐跟在老師身邊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有時候真不知道該說你呆，還是機靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師姐，那我先下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。這兩人都是絕頂高手，他們的戰鬥恐怕會顛覆你錄武簿大半的記錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會盡可能記錄得詳細準確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要離他們太近，免得受傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，師姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"narration","text":"半日前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在今天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你準備好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽幾個老兵說，玉門遭遇的劫難大大小小不下百次，但從沒有過這麼大的陣仗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次的結果會是怎樣，連你也沒有把握吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情勢比表面上要更複雜。"},{"type":"narration","text":"從姜齊到玉門，自己經歷過多少次危險，又有多少次命懸一線？\n沒有暴屍荒野，也沒有淪為山海眾那樣的惡徒。\n支撐著自己的是什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在這座城市待了這麼久，受過大家許多照顧，也該出把力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在此之前，我必須先給自己一個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說過的，只要我想動手，你隨時奉陪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不必多說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然準備好了，那出劍便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍客後退一步，凝神，舉劍。\n她很清楚，自己的一招一式，眼前的人都瞭若指掌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"人們常說，有仇報仇，生生世世。\n與其說這是一句顛撲不破的道理，不如說它是一種結果。\n曾經有多少人經過水寨時葬身江底，他們的親人是否也應該向爹尋仇？\n自己為尋仇而來，殺了眼前這個人，又有多少人應該向自己尋仇？\n有仇報仇，血債血償。殺業循環，生生世世。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"支撐著自己一路走下去的，應該是，仇恨嗎？\n這個問題自己想了多久？跟在眼前這人身邊，見他所見的這五年？\n不，比這更久。\n從姜齊到玉門，手裡的劍早就已經染過血。我該如何為那些亡魂判定是非善惡？\n正因如此，我才會來到玉門，既為報仇，也為問劍。\n報該報的仇，解該解的惑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i15"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍勢未盡，陡然回收。\n長劍脫手，落入稍遠處的水渠，一排羽獸受驚飛起，鳴聲嘹亮，許久才散盡。\n全然不像在練劍或迎敵時那樣瀟灑，收勁時的慣性差點讓她受傷。\n但劍客的表情卻是釋然的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這樣就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這一劍已經刺出去了。這一劍殺不了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我並非因為殺不了你才放下報仇的念頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是“仇恨”早已不再值得我出劍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"自己是在什麼時候有的答案呢？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看閣下的腳步，這三年來，想必武功又精進了許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們話說得太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......"},{"type":"narration","text":"重岳收回了後半句話。\n對手身上還帶著傷，多聊上幾句，他就能多點時間來調勻呼吸。\n可他旋即意識到了，這點體諒對眼前的人來說，只能算是羞辱。\n世間從來就沒有絕對公平的戰鬥。\n拋開雜念，懷求勝的心，使百分的力，便是“公平”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開始吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i10"},{"type":"narration","text":"槐天裴握緊了拳頭，每一道粗糲的掌紋都清晰可感。\n那是練拳留下的痕跡，是習武四十年的底色和豪氣。\n他為這一戰等待了三年，但他為了這一戰做的準備，要從習武的第一天算起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"武者攀高，當凌絕頂。\n萬籟無聲，風停雲遏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
